ora do roteiro comum."],"ans":2},{"q":"O que significa: Put it on the map.","say":"Put it on the map.","opts":["É uma joia escondida.","Colocar no mapa.","Fica fora do roteiro comum.","É o coração da cidade."],"ans":1}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"phrases","min":2,"items":[{"en":"What's your city like?","pt":"Como é a sua cidade?"},{"en":"It's big and noisy.","pt":"É grande e barulhenta."},{"en":"It's very beautiful.","pt":"É muito bonita."},{"en":"There are many parks.","pt":"Há muitos parques."},{"en":"It isn't crowded.","pt":"Não é cheia."},{"en":"It's an old city.","pt":"É uma cidade antiga."},{"en":"I love living here.","pt":"Adoro morar aqui."},{"en":"It's peaceful at night.","pt":"É tranquila à noite."}]},{"t":"shadow","min":2,"items":["What's your city like?","It's big and noisy.","It's very beautiful.","There are many parks.","It isn't crowded.","It's an old city.","What's your city like, Ida?","It's big and modern, but it isn't noisy."]},{"t":"grammar","min":2,"title":"There is / there are","formula":"[There is] + singular  |  [There are] + plural","rule":"Use there is (there's) com singular ou incontável, e there are com plural. Pergunta: Is there…? / Are there…?","ex":[{"en":"There is a sofa.","pt":"Há um sofá."},{"en":"There are two beds.","pt":"Há duas camas."},{"en":"Is there a garden?","pt":"Há um jardim?"}],"mist":[{"bad":"There have a sofa.","good":"There is a sofa."},{"bad":"There is two beds.","good":"There are two beds."}],"tip":""},{"t":"pattern","min":1,"frame":"It's {1}.","note":"Adjetivos de lugar.","slots":[{"en":"big","pt":"grande"},{"en":"small","pt":"pequeno"},{"en":"quiet","pt":"quieto"},{"en":"noisy","pt":"barulhento"},{"en":"beautiful","pt":"bonito"},{"en":"clean","pt":"limpo"}]},{"t":"drill","min":2,"frame":"It's {1}.","cues":[{"en":"big","pt":"grande"},{"en":"small","pt":"pequeno"},{"en":"quiet","pt":"quieto"},{"en":"noisy","pt":"barulhento"},{"en":"beautiful","pt":"bonito"},{"en":"clean","pt":"limpo"}]},{"t":"mcq","min":2,"title":"Caça ao erro","items":[{"q":"Qual frase está correta?","opts":["There have a sofa.","There is a sofa."],"ans":1},{"q":"Qual frase está correta?","opts":["There is two beds.","There are two beds."],"ans":1}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"verbs","min":2,"items":[{"base":"live","s":"lives","ing":"living","past":"lived","pp":"lived","pt":"morar/viver","irr":false},{"base":"love","s":"loves","ing":"loving","past":"loved","pp":"loved","pt":"amar","irr":false},{"base":"visit","s":"visits","ing":"visiting","past":"visited","pp":"visited","pt":"visitar","irr":false},{"base":"walk","s":"walks","ing":"walking","past":"walked","pp":"walked","pt":"caminhar","irr":false},{"base":"enjoy","s":"enjoys","ing":"enjoying","past":"enjoyed","pp":"enjoyed","pt":"curtir","irr":false}]},{"t":"mcq","min":2,"title":"Verbos: escolha a forma certa","items":[{"q":"She _____ every day.  (live)","opts":["lives","living","live","lived"],"ans":0},{"q":"They _____ yesterday.  (love)","opts":["loved","loves","love","loving"],"ans":0},{"q":"He is _____ now.  (visit)","opts":["visited","visit","visiting","visits"],"ans":2},{"q":"We have already _____.  (walk)","opts":["walking","walked","walk","walks"],"ans":1},{"q":"I _____ every day.  (enjoy)","opts":["enjoyed","enjoys","enjoy","enjoying"],"ans":2}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"scramble","min":2,"items":[{"words":["What's","your","city","like","?"],"en":"What's your city like?","pt":"Como é a sua cidade?"},{"words":["It's","big","and","noisy","."],"en":"It's big and noisy.","pt":"É grande e barulhenta."},{"words":["It's","very","beautiful","."],"en":"It's very beautiful.","pt":"É muito bonita."},{"words":["There","are","many","parks","."],"en":"There are many parks.","pt":"Há muitos parques."},{"words":["It","isn't","crowded","."],"en":"It isn't crowded.","pt":"Não é cheia."}]},{"t":"gap","min":1,"items":[{"before":"It's","after":"and modern, but it isn't noisy.","ans":"big","opts":["bag","ticket","big","peaceful"],"ci":2,"who":"Ida","pt":"É grande e moderna, mas não é barul