 city' e 'a small town' são tema de muitas conversas.","kind":"Curiosidade"},{"t":"read","min":3,"title":"Two cities","text":"Ida lives in a big city with tall buildings, wide streets and many parks. Diego lives on Maple Street, a small street with trees, a bakery and a plaza. Ida's city is busy, but it has great museums. Diego's street is quiet, and everybody knows each other. Both of them love their homes.","pt":"Uma cidade grande e uma rua pequena, cada uma com o seu charme.","qs":[{"q":"O que a cidade de Ida tem?","opts":["Many parks and museums","A beach","Mountains"],"ans":0},{"q":"Como é a rua de Diego?","opts":["Dangerous","Dirty","Quiet"],"ans":2}]},{"t":"cloze","min":2,"text":"Ida lives in a big {{city}} with tall buildings, wide streets and {{many}} parks. Diego lives on Maple Street, a {{small}} street with trees, a bakery and a plaza. {{Ida's}} city is busy, but it has great museums. Diego's street is {{quiet}}, and everybody knows each other. {{Both}} of them love their homes.","bank":["city","Ida's","Both","many","small","quiet"]},{"t":"mcq","min":1,"title":"Como se diz em inglês?","items":[{"q":"Como é a sua cidade?","opts":["I love living here.","What's your city like?","It's very beautiful."],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"É grande e barulhenta.","opts":["It's peaceful at night.","It's big and noisy.","It isn't crowded."],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"É muito bonita.","opts":["It's very beautiful.","It's big and noisy.","It's an old city."],"ans":0,"say":null},{"q":"Há muitos parques.","opts":["There are many parks.","It's peaceful at night.","What's your city like?"],"ans":0,"say":null},{"q":"Não é cheia.","opts":["I love living here.","It isn't crowded.","It's an old city."],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"É uma cidade antiga.","opts":["It isn't crowded.","It's an old city.","What's your city like?"],"ans":1,"say":null}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"dict","min":2,"items":["It's very beautiful.","There are many parks.","It isn't crowded.","It's big and modern, but it is